    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 54 (3), Regulations of National Sports Associations, published in theGazette (Extraordinary) No. 1825/ 38 of 30th of August 2013, made under Section 41 of the Sports Law, No. 25 of 1973,I, Dayasiri Jayasekara, Minister of Sports, do by this order direct Kaludura Shantha Ruwanchandra de Silva the DirectorGeneral of the Department of Sports Development, under the Ministry of Sports to convene and conduct a meeting ofSri Lanka Auto Mobile Sports Association to elect new office bearers.",
